random-locality
===============

This is a set of two scripts, generated by Gemini and corrected by me (when needed):

(1) a Python script (save-everything.py) which saves all Mauritian localities, sub-localities and postcodes from the Mauritius Post website. The output is a JSON file called mauritius_localities.json with all the information scraped.
(2) a Bash script (random-locality) which reads the JSON file (at $HOME/.mauritius_localities.json) and shows one locality, one sub-locality and one postcode at random.

These scripts can be useful for tourists and Mauritians alike. I use this script to know where to drive to...

Avinash Meetoo
https://www.avinashmeetoo.com/
